.TH "spa-inspect" 1 "1.6.8" "PipeWire" \" -*- nroff -*-
.ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
spa-inspect \- The PipeWire SPA plugin information utility

.PP
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP

.PP
\fBspa-inspect\fP \fIFILE\fP

.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP

.PP
Displays information about a SPA plugin\&.

.PP
Lists the SPA factories contained, and tries to instantiate them\&.

.PP
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.PP

.PP
\fBspa-inspect\fP /usr/lib/spa-0\&.2/bluez5/libspa-codec-bluez5-sbc\&.so

.PP
Display information about a plugin\&.

.PP
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP

.PP
The PipeWire Developers <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pipewire/pipewire/issues>; PipeWire is available from <https://pipewire.org>

.PP
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP

.PP
\fBpipewire(1)\fP 

